### Backend — Controller Layer

#### [MODIFY] [analytics.controller.ts](file:///d:/Workspace/URLShortener/server/app/controllers/analytics.controller.ts)

**Replace** `getLinkAnalytics` with `getGroupedLinkAnalytics`:

```
1. Extract userId from req.user
2. Read validated params: { shortCode, groupBy, start, end, timezone } from req.query + req.params
3. Verify link ownership (isLinkOwnedByUser) — skip for top_links
4. Check subscription (getActivePlanContext → allow_analytics)
5. switch(groupBy):
     case 'timeseries': items = await getTimeseriesAnalytics(...)
     case 'referrers':  items = await getReferrersAnalytics(...)
     case 'countries':  items = await getCountriesAnalytics(...)
     case 'devices':    items = await getDevicesAnalytics(...)
     case 'top_links':  items = await getTopLinksAnalytics(userId, ...)
6. Return { success: true, data: { groupBy, items } }
```

`getLinkClickLogs` is **unchanged**.

